    `WaveformPeakMath.recordingLiveBuckets`=160) + `services/VoiceRecordingPolicy.kt` (decision table:
    30 min `MAX_RECORDING_DURATION_MS`, 32 MB `MAX_RECORDING_BYTES`, 100 ms tick,
